{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46947","headline":"寄朗陵二禅友 · 齐己","name":"寄朗陵二禅友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潇湘曾宿话诗评，荆楚连秋阻野情。\n金锡罢游双鬓白，铁盂终守一斋清。\n篇章老欲齐高手，风月闲思到极精。\n南望山门石何处，沧浪云梦浸天横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}